WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.798
Deterministic ordering matters when you use
ROW_NUMBER If

00:00:05.824 --> 00:00:12.540
two employees have equal salary salary alone does
not define which comes first Adding

00:00:12.567 --> 00:00:18.089
employee ID creates a stable order But be careful
with RANK

00:00:18.102 --> 00:00:23.770
and DENSE_RANK If you include employee ID inside the
ranking

00:00:23.783 --> 00:00:29.572
ORDER BY the tied salary rows are no longer peers
Choose the ordering

00:00:29.599 --> 00:00:31.151
based on the meaning you want
